  "pricingText": "Your request will cost **$0.15** per image. For **$1.00**, you can run this model **7** times. 4K outputs will be charged at double the standard rate. If web search is used, an additional $0.015 will be charged. Note: Pricing may change in the future.\n\nFor more details, see [fal.ai pricing](https://fal.ai/pricing)."
